/**
 * The icons this app draws: the Solar set in its bold duotone cut, as path data.
 *
 * Every glyph is two layers, a solid mark and a half-opacity body behind it, so one tint
 * reads as two tones on any surface without a second colour to keep in step. The icon
 * libraries were the alternative, and the extended Material set is several megabytes of
 * generated classes that would all ship: the release build is debuggable for the Test
 * Store, so R8 never runs. These paths cost about 70 KB.
 *
 * Source: Solar icon set by 480 Design, CC BY 4.0, fetched from the Iconify API.
 */
